  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* feat(daemon): add protocol version compatibility checks by @jordond in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/141\r\n* feat: respect XDG Base Directory environment variables by @jordond in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/142\r\n* feat(ui): add transparent background setting by @jordond in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/149\r\n* clean(linux): remove the daemon control command when compiling for linux by @0x61nas in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/120\r\n* fix(macos): detect low power mode with flexible whitespace parsing by @McNight in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/152\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @0x61nas made their first contribution in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/120\r\n* @McNight made their first contribution in https://github.com/jordond/jolt/pull/152\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jordond/jolt/compare/1.1.3...1.2.0",
